===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|judgment|al}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɛntəl|s=3}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of or relating to [[judgment]].
# {{lb|en|chiefly|of a person}} Inclined to rashly pass judgment, [[critical]].

====Usage notes====
* Though both {{m|en||judgemental}} and {{m|en|judgmental}} are common spellings, the latter is significantly more so in American English, the former in British English.

